1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,541
Second, isobaric: constant pressure.

2
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:07,174
Put a fixed weight on a free piston and heat the gas.

3
00:00:07,174 --> 00:00:12,096
It warms and expands, pushing the piston up against the same pressure.

4
00:00:12,096 --> 00:00:13,554
A horizontal line.

5
00:00:13,554 --> 00:00:19,283
Now the heat does two jobs: Q equals delta U plus P delta V.

